{
  "name": "Shopify Competitor Churn Leads to Slack (Apify)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n1. Create an n8n **Header Auth** credential named `Apify API Token (Header Auth)`:\n   - Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer <your Apify API token>`\n2. Select it on the **Apify** HTTP Request node.\n3. Replace the app slugs in the request body with your competitors' Shopify App Store slugs.\n4. Select your Slack credential on **Post Churn Lead to Slack** and set the channel.\n\nThe request asks for 1-2 star reviews only (`reviewStarFilter: \"churn_1_to_2\"`), newest first, with app profiles off, so you pay only for `review-scraped` events.\n\nOne Slack message is posted per churn candidate. Each run re-reads the newest reviews, so keep `maxReviewsPerApp` small to limit repeats between runs.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "0",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/K8dbxvC63ovXWi6wk/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"apps\": [\n    \"klaviyo-email-marketing\"\n  ],\n  \"includeAppDetails\": false,\n  \"includeReviews\": true,\n  \"maxReviewsPerApp\": 10,\n  \"reviewStarFilter\": \"churn_1_to_2\",\n  \"reviewSort\": \"newest\",\n  \"enrichDeveloperContacts\": false\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "2",
      "name": "Apify: Shopify App Store Scraper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Apify API Token (Header Auth)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-churn",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.isChurnCandidate }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "3",
      "name": "Is Churn Candidate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        760,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#churn-leads",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=:rotating_light: *Churn lead on {{ $json.appName || $json.appSlug }}* | {{ $json.rating }} star | {{ $json.reviewDate || 'date unknown' }}\n*Merchant:* {{ $json.merchantName || 'Unknown' }}{{ $json.merchantCountry ? ' (' + $json.merchantCountry + ')' : '' }}{{ $json.tenureText ? ' | ' + $json.tenureText : '' }}\n*Signals:* {{ ($json.churnSignals || []).join(', ') || 'none' }}\n*Developer replied:* {{ $json.hasDeveloperReply ? 'yes' : 'no' }}\n> {{ ($json.reviewBody || '').replace(/\\n+/g, ' ').slice(0, 600) }}\n{{ $json.reviewsPageUrl }}",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "id": "4",
      "name": "Post Churn Lead to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        240
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Apify: Shopify App Store Scraper",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Apify: Shopify App Store Scraper": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Is Churn Candidate",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Is Churn Candidate": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post Churn Lead to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
